{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2023-05-03 19:22:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON & JOHNSON AND KENVUE ANNOUNCE PRICING OF UPSIZED KENVUE INC. INITIAL PUBLIC OFFERING', 'text': "NEW BRUNSWICK, N.J. & SKILLMAN, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--JOHNSON & JOHNSON (NYSE: JNJ) AND KENVUE INC. (“KENVUE”), A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF JOHNSON & JOHNSON, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE PRICING OF KENVUE'S UPSIZED INITIAL PUBLIC OFFERING (“IPO”) OF 172,812,560 SHARES OF KENVUE'S COMMON STOCK AT A PRICE TO THE PUBLIC OF $22.00 PER SHARE. IN ADDITION, KENVUE HAS GRANTED THE UNDERWRITERS A 30-DAY OPTION TO PURCHASE UP TO AN ADDITIONAL 25,921,884 SHARES OF ITS COMMON STOCK TO COVER OVER-ALLOTMEN."}